            "review_title": "Review at Mais Thai Cusine",
            "review_text": "Trixie\nDa Nang, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nCheap Menu - Authentic Thai Taste - Good Service\nFeb 2020\nI do love foods in Mais Thai Cusine. Their foods are very tasty, authentic Thai foods and cheaper than other Thai restaurants. I eat there every day and also order for my husband. The sibling owners are both friendly. They give me very good service. Thank you so much and I hope your restaurant grows big and famous.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 17, 2020\nMai's Thai Cusine\nDear Trixie,\n\nThank you so much for giving your review to our restaurant. We really appreciate your time and your words that you spent to write about our service and our food.\n\nWe always hope to serve you better than what you expect from us. \nHave a great year!\n\nMai's Thai Cusine\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
